1
00:00:00,980 --> 00:00:03,760
(Howard:)20 minutes in,
they find a prune pit.

2
00:00:05,418 --> 00:00:09,888
(Raj:)Actually, how do you feel about
watching House of 1000 Corpses?

3
00:00:10,056 --> 00:00:13,266
(Howard:)A straight-up gore-fest?
You hate this stuff.

4
00:00:13,426 --> 00:00:15,426
(Raj:)I do, but for some reason,
Emily loves it

5
00:00:15,595 --> 00:00:16,905
(Raj:)and wants to watch it
with me tomorrow,

6
00:00:17,063 --> 00:00:18,603
(Raj:)so I thought if
I saw it with you first,

7
00:00:18,765 --> 00:00:21,145
(Raj:)then I could act cool
about it with her.

8
00:00:21,300 --> 00:00:23,180
(Howard:)That's actually not a bad plan.

9
00:00:23,336 --> 00:00:25,006
(Howard:)I can sit through
the colonoscopy now,

10
00:00:25,171 --> 00:00:28,281
(Howard:)but that first time I was like,
"Oh, my God, a prune pit!"

11
00:00:33,813 --> 00:00:35,853
-So you'd watch it?
-Sure.

12
00:00:36,015 --> 00:00:37,795
(Raj:)You're a good friend.
I owe you one.

13
00:00:37,950 --> 00:00:41,760
Howard!
Help me get out of the tub!

14
00:00:46,259 --> 00:00:48,039
(Raj:)Not that one.

15
00:00:50,763 --> 00:00:53,043
(Sheldon:)So we're just randomly
choosing a restaurant

16
00:00:53,199 --> 00:00:55,309
(Sheldon:)-without researching it online?
-Yep.

17
00:00:55,468 --> 00:00:56,948
(Leonard:)Great.

18
00:00:57,103 --> 00:00:59,023
(Sheldon:)This is how Anything Can
Happen Thursday turns

